Built on NVIDIA Cosmos.

The image that docker/Dockerfile.serve-gr00t-n17-droid builds contains two models from NVIDIA
Corporation, at the revisions that the recipe pins:
- nvidia/GR00T-N1.7-DROID, the policy.
- nvidia/Cosmos-Reason2-2B, its backbone, an NVIDIA Cosmos Model.
The NVIDIA Open Model License Agreement governs both. The image holds a copy of the agreement at
/opt/gr00t/LICENSE-NVIDIA-Open-Model-License.txt. The same text, last modified October 24, 2025, is at
https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/agreements/enterprise-software/nvidia-open-model-license/.

Positronic packaged the models with a serving entry point of its own. Positronic did not change the
model weights. This image is not an official product of NVIDIA Corporation.
